    "norm": "Tests complex and recursive substitution in variable names. <p>With substitution-in-variables enabled, a variable name may itself contain variables. The inner variables are resolved first, building up the name of the outer variable to look up. For example, in {@code ${animal.${species.${color}}}} the lookups resolve from the inside out:</p> <ol> <li>{@code ${color}} -> \"white\"</li> <li>{@code ${species.white}} -> \"1\"</li> <li>{@code ${animal.1}} -> \"white mouse\"</li> </ol>"
